sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Roster at parent commit
    participant C as New commit (roster edit)
    participant H as Every host
    C->>P: Who signed me?
    P-->>C: Key trusted at parent? class permits paths?
    Note over C: Merge: EVERY parent must verify independently
    alt trusted at parent
        H->>H: Accept; roster advances
    else unknown / removed / class refusal
        H->>H: HOLD held items + alert by name
    end
